## Hello from Keystatic

This site now loads blog content from **Git-backed Markdoc** files managed in
`/keystatic`, with media intended for **Cloudflare R2**.

### What changed

- Notion database + block trees are gone from the blog pipeline
- Cover images are plain **URL or R2 object key** strings (no ImageKit path)
- Body content is Markdoc: *italic*, **bold**, [links](https://www.haikonguyen.eu), headings, quotes, and code

> Paste an R2 public URL into the cover field, or an object key like
> `blog/covers/my-cover.jpg` when `NEXT_PUBLIC_R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` is set.

```ts
import { getAllPosts } from '@lib/keystatic';

const posts = await getAllPosts();
```

Edit this post at `/keystatic` — saving writes `content/posts/*.mdoc`.
